H. Gao, S. Chen, B. Jiang, B. Liao, Y. Shi, X. Guo, Y. Pu, H. Yin, X. Li, X. Zhang, Y. Zhang, W. Liu, Q. Zhang, and X. Wang, “Rad: Training an end-to-end driving policy via large-scale 3dgs-based reinforcement learning,” 2025. [Online]. Available: </span><a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.13144" title="" class="ltx_ref ltx_url ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;">https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.13144</a><span id="bib.bib12.5" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
</span>
</span></li>
      
<li id="bib.bib13" class="ltx_bibitem"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_role_refnum ltx_tag_bibitem"><span id="bib.bib13.2" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">[13]</span></span>
